OL,3,GNEWSAMayor announces #3.7m of funding
OL,4,Ato help homeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FNearly #4m has been pledged by the West
OL,7,FYorkshire Combined Authority (WYCA) to
OL,8,Fhelp people sleeping rough across the
OL,9,Fregion.
OL,11,FWest Yorkshire Mayor Tracy Brabin said
OL,12,Fthe #3.7m would help provide
OL,13,Faccommodation and targeted support to
OL,14,Fpeople with the most complex needs.
OL,16,FIt comes after the government said it
OL,17,Fwas doubling its funding in support of
OL,18,FPrime Minster Andy Burnham's pledge to
OL,19,Fgive every rough sleeper in England a
OL,20,Froute off the streets by Christmas.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
