OL,3,GNEWSAMayor announces #3.7m of funding
OL,4,Ato help homeless
OL,5,
OL,6,FAccording to the latest government
OL,7,Fdata, at least 141 people are thought
OL,8,Fto be experiencing rough sleeping every
OL,9,Fnight across West Yorkshire.
